# The build context is apps/backend, which also holds api-gateway's node_modules. Without this, every
# build ships hundreds of megabytes of JavaScript to the daemon for nothing. (BuildKit reads this file
# because it sits next to Dockerfile.spring; the repository-root .dockerignore does not apply to a
# narrower context.)
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
api-gateway
